Package: targetree
Type: Package
Title: Threshold-Focused Classification and Regression Trees
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Lei Bill", "Wang", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "Bill-Wang-Metrics@users.noreply.github.com"),
    person("Targetree contributors", role = "ctb")
    )
Description: Fits classification and regression trees using standard CART
    impurity splits, Penalized Final Splits (PFS), or Maximum Distance Final
    Splits (MDFS). The latter methods focus terminal splits on a user-selected
    probability threshold. The package also supports categorical predictors,
    probability-assisted fitting, honest leaf estimation, risk counts, text
    output, and tree visualization.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: R6, graphics, grDevices
LazyData: true
URL: https://github.com/Bill-Wang-Metrics/targetree-r
BugReports: https://github.com/Bill-Wang-Metrics/targetree-r/issues
